// so that data exported from this variant slots directly into the same
// analysis pipeline / assignment_id space as the main study's export. Do
// NOT run scripts/build_assignments.py against this file — it always
// regenerates the full 60-row table.
//
// Participant index modulo 6 (this file's cycle_length) selects the row.
// src/main.js has one corresponding change from the main experiment: it
// derives `condition` from the picked assignment's own `assignment_id`
// (11/18/24/33/47/52) rather than from the raw 0..5 pIndex, so each story
// set keeps the EXACT condition (linear/nonlinear/atemporal) it was
// preregistered with in the full 60-slot design (condition = assignment_id
// mod 3). Using the local 0..5 index instead would silently reassign the
// wrong condition to 4 of these 6 story sets.

